    "description": {
      "value": "<p><strong>Prerequisites:</strong> Dead Money gambit</p><p>Debt doesn't stop at the grave. Should a creature be killed or otherwise incapacitated while still inflicted with Dead Money, you may attempt to transfer the affliction to another creature within 30 feet as a free action that may be taken out of turn, also renewing its duration. A successful Fortitude save (DC: 10 + half your gambler level + your Charisma modifier) negates this effect.</p>",
